msgid "**Type**: ``ENCODESearchBiosamplesTool``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/encode_tools.rst:161 dee5651170814412932723e8a1383c68
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search ENCODE biosamples (cell lines, tissues, primary "
"cells) by organism, biosample type, or treatment. Returns biosample "
"accessions, types, organism, life stage, and descriptions. Use this to "
"discover biological samples used in ENCODE experiments, find cell lines "
"or tissues of interest, or identify treated vs. control samples. Find "
"biosample accessions to use with ENCODE\\_get\\_biosample for detailed "
"characterization data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/encode_tools.rst:165 4283c9eddec04f23bd92f7239ed0154d
msgid ""
"``organism`` (string) (optional) Organism filter (e.g., 'Homo sapiens', "
"'Mus musculus')."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/encode_tools.rst:168 be01ad98908248f18fca32c1dc889a10
msgid ""
"``biosample_type`` (string) (optional) Biosample classification filter — "
"maps to ENCODE's biosample\\_ontology.classification field (e.g., 'cell "
"line', 'tissue', 'primary cell', 'in vitro differentiated cells')."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/encode_tools.rst:171 e7c88da338724111831975f8d1f457a8
msgid ""
"``treatment`` (string) (optional) Treatment filter (e.g., 'interferon "
"gamma', 'ethanol'). Use '\\*' to find any treated samples."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/encode_tools.rst:190 8d2ac6ce58e24337a05038ac79388de3
msgid "**ENCODE_search_experiments** (Type: ENCODESearchTool)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/encode_tools.rst:192 62ef35928d174d6aae48c708df73ce8e
msgid ""
"Search ENCODE functional genomics experiments (e.g., ChIP-seq, ATAC-seq, "
"RNA-seq) by assay type, ..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/encode_tools.rst 800b7c6021a148c2bc348b53f76272e0
msgid "ENCODE_search_experiments tool specification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/encode_tools.rst:198 bb68ad3d850a4418b31f9ae4797fe805
msgid "**Name**: ``ENCODE_search_experiments``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/encode_tools.rst:199 c2c3af70f3e14cb383440673dd33315f
msgid "**Type**: ``ENCODESearchTool``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/encode_tools.rst:200 32e666a0e8bf48cc880957107a27c879
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search ENCODE functional genomics experiments (e.g., "
"ChIP-seq, ATAC-seq, RNA-seq) by assay type, target protein, organism, or "
"status. Returns experiment accessions, descriptions, and metadata. Use "
"this to discover datasets for specific assays, transcription factors, or "
"cell types. Find experiment accessions to use with "
"ENCODE\\_get\\_experiment for detailed information or "
"ENCODE\\_list\\_files for downloading data files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/encode_tools.rst:204 bd3134b438f442ffa110ab4157003cec
msgid ""
"``assay_title`` (string) (optional) Assay name filter (e.g., 'TF ChIP-"
"seq', 'Histone ChIP-seq', 'ATAC-seq', 'RNA-seq', 'Hi-C'). Leave empty to "
"search all assays. Use 'TF ChIP-seq' for transcription factor binding "
"experiments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/encode_tools.rst:207 bd23f2ca7861431a819f4fece00b95b7
msgid ""
"``target`` (string) (optional) Target protein/factor filter (e.g., "
"'CTCF', 'H3K4me3', 'POLR2A'). Use for TF ChIP-seq experiments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/encode_tools.rst:210 d2c8839387b74baa8d475aadefd4a6af
msgid ""
"``organism`` (string) (optional) Organism filter — maps to ENCODE's "
"organism scientific name field (e.g., 'Homo sapiens', 'Mus musculus', "
"'Drosophila melanogaster')."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/encode_tools.rst:213 fd236965d3074278affafbea3f69363b
msgid ""
"``status`` (string) (optional) Record status filter. Use 'released' for "
"public data (default), 'archived' for older data."
msgstr ""

